     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>We just posted on SO: </div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22120397/r-shiny-error-in-handlerbinary-message-no-handler-registered-matrix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22120397/r-shiny-error-in-handlerbinary-message-no-handler-registered-matrix&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404607455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0isb4MPqQ0TK6KHAUVFM20\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22120397/r-shiny-error-in-handlerbinary-message-no-handler-registered-matrix</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>but here is this as well, in case somebody of the group can give us a hand:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">I decided to reproduce the html code of the following link (because I would like to change it slightly):<a href=\"http://spark.rstudio.com/gsdesign/matrix/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(74,107,130)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://spark.rstudio.com/gsdesign/matrix/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404607455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XciRI4NKt74j1lhNkSO6m\">http://spark.rstudio.com/gsdesign/matrix/</a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">I copy-pasted it in my file:static_temp.html</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Since the code includes tableinput.css and tableinput.js, I downloaded these files and inserted them in my folder with ui.R, server.R and static_temp.html.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);fo